# Crumbling Vestige: "This land enters tapped. When this land enters, add one mana of any color." The trigger goes on the stack
# (it is not a mana ability, CR 605.1b) and the color is chosen as it resolves: Bot1 picks green, which nothing else of Bot1's makes,
# and the pool holds exactly {G}. The land is tapped, so it can't make {C} that turn; next turn it taps for exactly {C} (CR 106.1b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Crumbling Vestige
Plains x6
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Crumbling Vestige.Play
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Crumbling Vestige.Tapped = true
Bot1.Colors(Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Stack.Count = 0
! Bot1.Battlefield.Crumbling Vestige.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Crumbling Vestige.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Crumbling Vestige.Tapped = true
